  "title": "Sri Lankan Milk Toffee",
  "description": "Condensed milk, sugar, cashew nuts, and butter combine to make this fudge-type milk toffee, a treat enjoyed in Sri Lanka on special occasions.",
  "authors": [
    "Darlene Weerasooriya"
